index 60cad06..1b332fd 100644
--- a/nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/video/README.md
+++ b/nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/video/README.md
@@ -11,6 +11,34 @@ decode → next_picture → copy_out into a LINEAR NV12 dma-buf → release fenc
